    "paragraph": "A systematic review of 87 publications from 2015 to 2025 combined PRISMA-guided analysis with institutional comparisons of India, Singapore, and Canada to evaluate AI applications in urban land valuation and spatial planning. A separate PRISMA-guided systematic review of 177 selected papers from Web of Science tracked the evolution of 3D urban modeling over the same decade. Finally, an expert evaluation of 78 public transport measures across 10 European cities classified interventions into four operational profiles using five performance dimensions.",
